# Preparing GDTB data

The GTDB v232 metadata is already prepared for the pipeline and stored in the inputs folder (compresed metadata_r[v].tsv.gz file). If another version of the GTDB database needs to be prepared, follow the steps below.

The GDTB metadata can be obtained at https://gtdb.ecogenomic.org/downloads
   Select one of the options, ex., Europe: https://data.gtdb.aau.ecogenomic.org/releases/
